    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#f0fdf4',
                            100: '#dcfce7',
                            500: '#22c55e',
                            600: '#16a34a',
                            700: '#15803d',
                            800: '#166534',
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f1f1f1;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #94a3b8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col">

    <!-- Header / Navbar -->
    <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-30 shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="bg-emerald-600 text-white p-2 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-leaf text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-none">EcoTrack</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-emerald-600 font-medium mt-0.5">Sistem Pintar Edukasi & Pengenal Sampah</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-6 text-sm font-medium">
                <a href="#katalog" class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold hover:text-emerald-800 transition">Katalog Sampah</a>
                <a href="#kuis" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-700 transition">Kuis Interaktif</a>
                <a href="#panduan" class="text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-700 transition">Panduan 3R</a>
            </nav>

            <div class="text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                Database Terbarui
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-900 via-emerald-800 to-slate-900 text-white py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 opacity-10 text-emerald-300 pointer-events-none">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-recycle text-[280px]"></i>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
            <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-400/30 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">
                Lingkungan Hidup & Keberlanjutan
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">
                Identifikasi Sampah, Ketahui Dampak & Solusinya
            </h2>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
                Cari jenis sampah di sekitar Anda untuk mempelajari klasifikasi, potensi pemanfaatan, ancaman lingkungan, serta cara pengelolaan yang paling ramah lingkungan.
            </p>

            <!-- Search Bar -->
            <div class="relative max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                <div class="relative">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400 text-lg"></i>
                    <input type="text" id="searchInput" 
                        placeholder="Ketik nama sampah (contoh: Botol Plastik, Baterai, Daun Kering)..." 
                        class="w-full pl-12 pr-28 py-4 bg-white text-slate-800 placeholder-slate-400 rounded-2xl shadow-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-emerald-400 transition text-sm sm:text-base">
                    <button id="clearSearchBtn" class="hidden absolute right-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg transition">
                        Reset
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 flex-grow w-full" id="katalog">

        <!-- Category Filters -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-8 border-b border-slate-200 pb-5">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" id="categoryFilters">
                <button data-category="all" class="filter-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold transition-all bg-emerald-600 text-white shadow-sm">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-border-all mr-1.5"></i> Semua (<span id="count-all">0</span>)
                </button>
                <button data-category="Organik" class="filter-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold transition-all bg-white text-slate-600 border border-slate-200 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-600">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-seedling text-emerald-500 mr-1.5"></i> Organik (<span id="count-organik">0</span>)
                </button>
                <button data-category="Anorganik" class="filter-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold transition-all bg-white text-slate-600 border border-slate-200 hover:border-blue-300 hover:text-blue-600">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bottle-water text-blue-500 mr-1.5"></i> Anorganik (<span id="count-anorganik">0</span>)
                </button>
                <button data-category="B3" class="filter-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold transition-all bg-white text-slate-600 border border-slate-200 hover:border-rose-300 hover:text-rose-600">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-rose-500 mr-1.5"></i> B3 (Berbahaya) (<span id="count-b3">0</span>)
                </button>
            </div>
            
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium flex items-center gap-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-info-circle text-slate-400"></i> Klik kartu item untuk melihat penjelasan detail
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Layout Grid: List/Cards & Detail Panel -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
            
            <!-- Left Grid: Waste Items Grid -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-3">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center px-1">
                    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Daftar Sampah</h3>
                    <span id="resultCount" class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md">8 Item</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Waste Item Container -->
                <div id="wasteGrid" class="space-y-2.5 max-h-[700px] overflow-y-auto pr-1 custom-scrollbar">
                    <!-- Populated via Javascript -->
                </div>

                <div id="noResults" class="hidden text-center py-12 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-300 p-6">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-box-open text-4xl text-slate-300 mb-3"></i>
                    <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-700">Sampah Tidak Ditemukan</h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Coba gunakan kata kunci lain seperti "plastik", "baterai", atau "daun".</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Grid: Detailed View Panel -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-7">
                <div class="sticky top-20">
                    <div id="detailCard" class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 transition-all duration-300">
                        <!-- Default placeholder state -->
                        <div id="detailPlaceholder" class="text-center py-16 px-4">
                            <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-3xl">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-chart"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">Pilih Sampah dari Daftar</h3>
                            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm max-w-sm mx-auto">
                                Klik salah satu item jenis sampah di sebelah kiri untuk menampilkan rincian penjelasan, kelebihan, kekurangan, dan solusi penanganannya.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Active Detail Content (Hidden initially) -->
                        <div id="detailContent" class="hidden space-y-6">
                            <!-- Top Header -->
                            <div class="flex items-start justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-5">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                                    <div id="detailIconContainer" class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-inner">
                                        <i id="detailIcon" class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <div>
                                        <div id="detailBadge" class="inline-block text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
                                            -
                                        </div>
                                        <h3 id="detailTitle" class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
                                            Nama Sampah
                                        </h3>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <span id="detailTime" class="text-xs bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-medium">
                                    Waktu urai: -
                                </span>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Overview Description -->
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 mb-1.5">Penjelasan & Gambaran Umum</h4>
                                <p id="detailDescription" class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                                    -
                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Advantage & Disadvantage Cards -->
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                                <!-- Kelebihan / Potensi Manfaat -->
                                <div class="bg-emerald-50/60 border border-emerald-200/70 rounded-2xl p-4">
                                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-emerald-800 font-bold text-sm mb-2">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-600"></i>
                                        <span>Kelebihan / Manfaat</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p id="detailPros" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-emerald-950 leading-relaxed">
                                        -
                                    </p>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Kekurangan / Dampak Lingkungan -->
                                <div class="bg-rose-50/60 border border-rose-200/70 rounded-2xl p-4">
                                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-rose-800 font-bold text-sm mb-2">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-rose-600"></i>
                                        <span>Kekurangan / Dampak</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p id="detailCons" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-rose-950 leading-relaxed">
                                        -
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Solutions & 3R Guidelines -->
                            <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-sm">
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm mb-3">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-lg"></i>
                                    <span>Solusi Pengelolaan & Mengatasi Pencemaran</span>
                                </div>
                                <p id="detailSolution" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                                    -
                                </p>
                                <div id="detailActionSteps" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-xs">
                                    <!-- Action badges injected by JS -->
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Interactive Quiz Section -->
        <section class="mt-16 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-10" id="kuis">
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                <div class="text-center mb-8">
                    <span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
                        Uji Pengetahuan Anda
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-2">Kuis Pemilahan Sampah</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">Uji seberapa baik Anda mengenali jenis sampah dan cara pemilahannya yang tepat.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Quiz Card Container -->
                <div id="quizContainer" class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200 relative">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4 text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase">
                        <span>Pertanyaan <span id="quizCurrentNum">1</span> dari <span id="quizTotalNum">3</span></span>
                        <span id="quizScoreText" class="text-emerald-600">Skor: 0</span>
                    </div>

                    <h3 id="quizQuestion" class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mb-5">
                        Memuat pertanyaan...
                    </h3>

                    <div id="quizOptions" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6">
                        <!-- Options populated via JS -->
                    </div>

                    <div id="quizFeedback" class="hidden p-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium mb-4"></div>

                    <div class="flex justify-end">
                        <button id="nextQuizBtn" class="hidden bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition shadow-md">
                            Pertanyaan Selanjutnya <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Quiz Results Overlay -->
                <div id="quizResultScreen" class="hidden bg-emerald-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-400/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3 text-3xl text-emerald-400">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold mb-1">Kuis Selesai!</h3>
                    <p class="text-emerald-200 text-sm mb-4">Terima kasih telah berpartisipasi menjaga bumi.</p>
                    <div class="text-4xl font-black text-emerald-400 mb-6" id="finalScoreDisplay">100 / 100</div>
                    <button id="restartQuizBtn" class="bg-white text-emerald-900 hover:bg-emerald-100 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
                        Coba Kuis Lagi
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3R Guidelines Section -->
        <section class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" id="panduan">
            <div class="bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 font-bold">
                    1
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Reduce (Kurangi)</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-emerald-100 leading-relaxed">
                    Mengurangi penggunaan barang sekali pakai yang berpotensi menjadi sampah. Membawa kantong belanja sendiri dan botol minum ulang (tumbler).
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-teal-700 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 font-bold">
                    2
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Reuse (Gunakan Kembali)</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-teal-100 leading-relaxed">
                    Memanfaatkan kembali barang-barang bekas tanpa proses pengolahan ulang, seperti menggunakan wadah bekas untuk tempat penyimpanan kreasi DIY.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-cyan-800 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 font-bold">
                    3
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Recycle (Daur Ulang)</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-cyan-100 leading-relaxed">
                    Mengolah kembali sampah menjadi barang baru yang berguna. Seperti mengubah limbah plastik menjadi bijih plastik atau sampah dapur menjadi kompos.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 py-8 mt-16 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 mb-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-leaf text-emerald-600"></i>
                <span class="font-bold text-slate-700">EcoTrack Indonesia</span>
            </div>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Aplikasi Edukasi Sampah & Pelestarian Lingkungan. Mari Bijak Mengelola Sampah.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- JavaScript Application Logic -->
